[00:00.000] 作词 : Noah Michael Howard
[00:00.361] 作曲 : Noah Michael Howard
[00:00.723]
[00:01.260]Verse 1:
[00:02.056]So bittersweet you almost taste it
[00:07.634]The minute that I came to say goodbye
[00:12.953]Some things you try but you can’t change them
[00:18.798]I wish that I could hold you one more time
[00:24.000]
[00:24.123]Pre-chorus:
[00:24.936]Look towards the dawn you’ll see me smiling down at you if you try to
[00:32.110]And after-all
[00:34.222]I’ll remind you
[00:35.557]
[00:36.099]Chorus:
[00:36.631]Slow down, don’t hate me
[00:41.698]I won’t lie you won’t make me
[00:47.047]I never tried to be your lover
[00:52.011]I just tried to stay
[00:57.008]You left me anyways
[00:58.073]
[00:58.329]Verse 2:
[00:58.609]Not far at all but you can’t go there
[01:03.924]A breathless sigh away from by my side
[01:09.499]Unfinished lies beneath the cold air
[01:15.352]Too many broken bones to stand upright
[01:19.000]
